[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0010","text":"对吧\n这是三峰的相机？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0020","text":"嗯？\n——啊，对对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0030","text":"都在拍些什么呀～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0040","text":"啊哈，要看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0050","text":"好可爱——\n你经常拍猫呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0060","text":"嗯，算是吧……！不过也会拍别的哦\n就是……各种让我心动的瞬间……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0070","text":"嘿——\n……那，没有我的照片，不是很奇怪吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0080","text":"可以吗？\n那我可要拜托你拍一张了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0090","text":"诶——\n这种事请通过事务所来联系～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_01_0100","text":"喂，原来不给我拍啊～！"}]
